 * Template for config.local.php (which is gitignored and holds real secrets).
 *
 * Copy this file to config.local.php and fill in the values:
 *
 *   cp config.local.php.dist config.local.php
 *
 * - signing_key: shared HS256 key (>= 32 bytes) used to mint (token.php) and
 *   verify (summary.php) the short-lived, patient-scoped JWT. Generate one with:
 *       php -r "echo bin2hex(random_bytes(32)) . PHP_EOL;"
 * - sidecar_url: absolute URL the browser posts questions to — the Python
 *   sidecar's /ask endpoint, e.g. http://localhost:8900/ask
 *
 * Either value may instead be supplied via the environment variables
 * OE_AI_AGENT_SIGNING_KEY / OE_AI_AGENT_SIDECAR_URL.
